{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S08把“暂时把回去的事放一边”推进成“却不想回头”，稍微提前替人物作了决定，不如Y保留当时的犹疑。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮的关键词让人很快抓住每段的心理转折，再用按音乐进程出现的细小感受补充具体体验，不必同时消化一整堆短词。更重要的是，它把离开后的解脱、怀念、孤独、动摇、不愿再忍到最终带着想念向前的变化串成了一条连续的心理线，既能理解人物为什么这样，也能感受到音乐内部细微的起伏。Y的双栏排法确实直观，但右侧不少感受同时罗列，容易看见情绪而不容易看清情绪之间的发生顺序和转变关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5cdcc786-b95b-4ba2-b173-d3c35c710429", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T062203913374Z", "elapsed_seconds": 72.516, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:23:16.437962+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5814a5604fc6f835c345a36a3a1d80f6cd7e247141aab64c8a94c9a8b089073b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt